<Base
  title="Terms & Sponsorship | Top Realtors Cypress TX"
  description="Who publishes this Cypress realtor guide, who pays for it, and how to use the information."
  path="/terms.html"
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap legal">
    <span class="eyebrow">About this guide</span>
    <h1>Terms &amp; sponsorship</h1>
    <h2>Who pays for this site</h2>
    <p>
      We provide marketing services to The Lippincott Team, and the team pays us
      to create and run this site. The Lippincott Team’s homepage card is a paid
      placement, and their directory row is marked Sponsored listing. Calling
      them our #1 choice is our editorial recommendation, not a calculated
      ranking or the result of independent testing.
    </p>
    <h2>Where our information comes from</h2>
    <p>
      Profiles summarize HAR pages, public HAR client comments and each
      realtor’s own website. Ratings are HAR client survey results for the named
      individual, not scores we calculate. Client comments are individual
      accounts, not a representative sample. We don’t accept visitor reviews.
    </p>
    <h2>Talking to a realtor</h2>
    <p>
      Contact realtors through their own websites or business phone numbers. We
      don’t represent you, take inquiries for anyone or set fees. Confirm
      licensing, services and representation terms with the realtor directly.
    </p>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      Rosters, brokerages and listings change. Check the linked source and its
      date before relying on a statement.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
